currentLocale&quot;:[0],&quot;markdown&quot;:[0,&quot;---\n\ntitle: Entitie=
s overview\nsubtitle: The data model, and how it powers your common operati=
ng picture\nhide-feedback: true\n-------------------\n\nAn **entity** is an=
