<h2 id=3D"entity-model" class=3D"max-md:pr-4" data-state=3D"closed" style=
=3D"cursor: pointer;">Entity model</h2>
<p>An entity requires the following components:</p>
<div class=3D"fern-api-property border-border-default border-b"><div class=
=3D"fern-api-property-header"><div class=3D"fern-api-property-key">entity_i=
d</div><div class=3D"fern-api-property-meta" data-markdown-ignore=3D""><spa=
n>String</span><span class=3D"text-(color:--red-a11)">Required</span></div>=
</div><div class=3D"fern-prose prose max-w-none break-words text-sm"><p>Uni=
que string identifier. Can be a Globally Unique Identifier (GUID).</p></div=
></div>
<div class=3D"fern-api-property border-border-default border-b"><div class=
=3D"fern-api-property-header"><div class=3D"fern-api-property-key">is_live<=
/div><div class=3D"fern-api-property-meta" data-markdown-ignore=3D""><span>=
Boolean</span><span class=3D"text-(color:--red-a11)">Required</span></div><=
/div><div class=3D"fern-prose prose max-w-none break-words text-sm"><p>A bo=
olean that when set to <code>true</code>, creates, or updates the entity.
If set to <code>false</code>, while the entity is still live, it triggers a
<code>DELETE</code> event.</p></div></div>
<div class=3D"fern-api-property border-border-default border-b"><div class=
=3D"fern-api-property-header"><div class=3D"fern-api-property-key">expiry_t=
ime</div><div class=3D"fern-api-property-meta" data-markdown-ignore=3D""><s=
pan>Datetime</span><span class=3D"text-(color:--red-a11)">Required</span></=
div></div><div class=3D"fern-prose prose max-w-none break-words text-sm"><p=
>The future time, less than 30 days, at which the entity expires. When the =
<code>expiry_time</code>
has passed, Lattice deletes the entity.</p></div></div>
<div class=3D"fern-api-property border-border-default border-b"><div class=
=3D"fern-api-property-header"><div class=3D"fern-api-property-key">provenan=
ce.integration_name</div><div class=3D"fern-api-property-meta" data-markdow=
n-ignore=3D""><span>string</span><span class=3D"text-(color:--red-a11)">Req=
uired</span></div></div><div class=3D"fern-prose prose max-w-none break-wor=
ds text-sm"><p>The name of the integration that created this entity.</p></d=
iv></div>
<div class=3D"fern-api-property border-border-default border-b"><div class=
=3D"fern-api-property-header"><div class=3D"fern-api-property-key">aliases.=
name</div><div class=3D"fern-api-property-meta" data-markdown-ignore=3D""><=
span>string</span></div></div><div class=3D"fern-prose prose max-w-none bre=
ak-words text-sm"><p>Human-readable string that represents the name of an e=
ntity.</p></div></div>
<p>For more information, see <a data-astro-prefetch=3D"viewport" class=3D"f=
ern-mdx-link" href=3D"https://developer.anduril.com/reference/rest/entities=
/publish-entity#request">Entities</a>
in the <em>Lattice API Reference</em>.</p>
<h2 id=3D"entity-templates" class=3D"max-md:pr-4" data-state=3D"closed" sty=
le=3D"cursor: pointer;">Entity templates</h2>
