<h3 id=3D"asset" class=3D"max-md:pr-4" data-state=3D"closed" style=3D"curso=
r: pointer;">Asset</h3>
<p>An <em>asset</em> is an entity under your control, or under the control =
of another operator or system.
Assets may accept tasks such as search or tracking. To create an asset, add=
 the following components in addition
to the required components:</p>
<div class=3D"fern-api-property border-border-default border-b"><div class=
=3D"fern-api-property-header"><div class=3D"fern-api-property-key">ontology=
</div><div class=3D"fern-api-property-meta" data-markdown-ignore=3D""><span=
>Ontology</span><span class=3D"text-(color:--red-a11)">Required</span></div=
></div><div class=3D"fern-prose prose max-w-none break-words text-sm"><p>Ad=
d the ontology component and set <a data-astro-prefetch=3D"viewport" class=
=3D"fern-mdx-link" href=3D"https://developer.anduril.com/reference/rest/ent=
ities/publish-entity#request.body.ontolog.template"><code>template</code></=
a>
to <code>TEMPLATE_ASSET</code> to render an asset in Lattice.</p></div></di=
v>
<div class=3D"fern-api-property border-border-default border-b"><div class=
=3D"fern-api-property-header"><div class=3D"fern-api-property-key">location=
</div><div class=3D"fern-api-property-meta" data-markdown-ignore=3D""><span=
>Location</span><span class=3D"text-(color:--red-a11)">Required</span></div=
></div><div class=3D"fern-prose prose max-w-none break-words text-sm"><p>Ad=
d the <a data-astro-prefetch=3D"viewport" class=3D"fern-mdx-link" href=3D"h=
ttps://developer.anduril.com/reference/rest/entities/publish-entity#request=
.body.location">location</a> component
and set the asset=E2=80=99s position using its latitude and longitude detai=
ls.</p></div></div>
<div class=3D"fern-api-property border-border-default border-b"><div class=
=3D"fern-api-property-header"><div class=3D"fern-api-property-key">milView<=
/div><div class=3D"fern-api-property-meta" data-markdown-ignore=3D""><span>=
MilView</span><span class=3D"text-(color:--red-a11)">Required</span></div><=
/div><div class=3D"fern-prose prose max-w-none break-words text-sm"><p>Add =
the <a data-astro-prefetch=3D"viewport" class=3D"fern-mdx-link" href=3D"htt=
ps://developer.anduril.com/reference/rest/entities/publish-entity#request.b=
ody.milView">milView</a> component
and set the disposition, environment, and nationality of the asset.</p></di=
v></div>
