r: pointer;">Track</h3>
<p>A <em>track</em> represents any entity tracked by an asset or integratio=
n connected to Lattice.
Tracks are not directly under the control of friendly forces. This includes=
 aircraft
tracks from radar or sensors, signal detections, vehicles, people, or anima=
ls detected through cameras.</p>
