nug">Persistence</div><br><ul class=3D"[&amp;&gt;li]:relative [&amp;&gt;li]=
:before:text-(color:--grayscale-a10) mb-3 list-none pl-3 [&amp;&gt;li]:pl-3=
 [&amp;&gt;li]:before:absolute [&amp;&gt;li]:before:ml-[-22px] [&amp;&gt;li=
]:before:mt-[-1px] [&amp;&gt;li]:before:content-['=E2=A6=81'] [&amp;&gt;li]=
:before:self-center">
<li class=3D"">
<p>If both <code>noExpiry</code> and <code>expiryTime</code> are set, Latti=
ce ignores
<code>expiryTime</code>.</p>
</li>
<li class=3D"">
<p>If a service restart occurs and an entity hasn=E2=80=99t been
republished within the previous 5 minutes, the entity will not be restored,=
 regardless of the
<code>noExpiry</code> setting.</p>
</li>
</ul></div></div></div><p>You should handle a delete event by removing all =
references to it in
memory or discarding it from your user interface.</p></div><!--/$--></div><=
